<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:id="ch-finaldiscussion" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Final Discussion Day</title>

  <p>
  <alert>Pre-class activity</alert>: Write a bullet-point list of six (6) things you have learned in this class that you believe will have a long-term impact on you as a teacher, as a learner, or as a person (unrelated to your professional life).
</p>

<activity>
<p>
  Share your lists with your group.
  Were there any items on your list that were shared among all or most of you?
  </p>
  </activity>

  <activity>
  <p>
    Whole-class discussion of the major takeaways from the course.
  </p>
  </activity>

  <activity>
  <p>
    Each student share one personal goal that they have for their TA work next semester.
  </p>
  </activity>

</chapter>